  "id": "section-921",
  "title": "干革命要有阶级感情",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-301.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>301)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　要搞好文化大革命就要和工农相结合，要有无产阶级感情，要有工农兵感情。<br>\n<br>\n<p>　　（据陈伯达同志一九六七年五月十一日在北京女六中讲话）</p>\n<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-300.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-302.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
